apply(ds4, P2, dup1): atomiswave: configured P2; dolphin: GCPad2 rebuilt from GCPad1, Wiimote2 set (SDL/1/PS4 Controller); dreamcast: configured P2; fds: configured P2; mame: configured P2; mastersystem: configured P2; megacd: configured P2; megadrive: configured P2; naomi: configured P2; naomigd: configured P2; nes: configured P2; rpcs3: Player 2 retargeted (PS4 Controller 2); ryujinx: Player 2 retargeted (dup 1, 00000003-054c-0000-cc09-000000006800); saturn: configured P2; sega32x: configured P2; sg1000: configured P2; snes9x: player 2 -> Joystick 2, 8 controls mapped (sdl)
